			"Message": "docs(Mountain): Standardize emoji spacing and escape special characters in README\n\nReformat all instances of the Mountain emoji (⛰️) and Land emoji (🏞️) to use the standard non-breaking space HTML entity (`&#x2001;`) instead of varied spacing or direct adjacency. This ensures consistent rendering across different Markdown viewers and aligns with the project's strict formatting guidelines.\n\nAdditionally, escape the ampersand in the 'Funding & Acknowledgements' header to prevent HTML parsing issues in stricter Markdown renderers.\n\nThe Mermaid diagram labels are also updated to move emojis to the end of text strings with consistent spacing, improving readability in generated diagrams while maintaining the original semantic content.",
			"SHA": "46e0d4dfd7cc35683abc48bf789e35eda895828f"
		},
